Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifteenth Episode\NThe Fox's Tale
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.02,0:02:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What are these horns?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.02,0:03:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A wild boar!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.34,0:03:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A fox proverb says that\Nwhere there is man, there is food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.06,0:04:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous, I know, but I want\Nto go look for food.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.54,0:04:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't met Zul yet in the\Nfox hunt, this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.98,0:04:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as well, Your Majesty,\Nbecause that fox is so clever
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.82,0:04:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...that it always causes us\Nan endless amount of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.10,0:04:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,People say that it can speak and\Nthat it is more intelligent than man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.42,0:04:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a very cunning fox
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.38,0:04:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly, Your Majesty!\NIt understands the speech of men
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.14,0:04:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...and all of their intentions,\Nso it manages to anticipate...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.70,0:04:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,...every move aimed at capturing it.\NIt is an extraordinary animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.10,0:04:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope to succeed in catching it.\NIt would be a magnificent trophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.74,0:04:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, its fur is beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.06,0:04:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be an excellent ornament\Nfor Her Majesty the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.22,0:04:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows where it might be hiding\Nat this moment...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.50,0:04:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot dog! What are you doing here?\NGo hunt with the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.58,0:04:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That animal has been bitten\Nby some beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.62,0:04:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Animals heal quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.14,0:05:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabotage!\NSomeone has sabotaged us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.14,0:05:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They broke\Nall the water jars!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.30,0:05:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What will we do now without water?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.54,0:05:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They put sand in its place!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.90,0:05:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And a frog in this pan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.22,0:05:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, at least the meat was saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.66,0:05:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No! They stole this too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.02,0:05:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.14,0:05:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldiers! I heard that Zul\Nis around here! Do you know where he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.70,0:05:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,She was here! She hurt\Nthis horse and she ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.82,0:05:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,She set a wild boar on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.86,0:05:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And maybe it was her\Nwho stole our provisions!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.06,0:05:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come this way!\NThere are Zul's footprints!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.26,0:05:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They're definitely his! Look:\Nhe's heading toward the forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.86,0:05:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's chase him! We must\Nteach him a good lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.18,0:05:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- This way!\N- Idiots! They fell for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.46,0:06:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I left my footprints walking\Nbackward all the way here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.54,0:06:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The more time passes the more\NI am convinced that humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.66,0:06:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...they are truly stupid\Nwithout a gram of brains!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.10,0:06:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Prince Sapphire!\N- What is it, lady? I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.02,0:06:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A message has arrived for\Nyou! It comes from Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.26,0:06:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,From Prince Franz?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.50,0:06:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,"Dear Prince Sapphire, how are you?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.66,0:06:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you still not found\Nthat girl I danced with?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.54,0:06:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If only he knew it was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.30,0:06:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How stupid you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.82,0:07:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it possible that you can't\Nguess that that girl is me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.90,0:07:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.22,0:07:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So you must be Zul!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.82,0:07:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,At your service, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.34,0:07:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you\Nsaying?! I am a Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.78,0:07:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell the truth: you, in reality,\Nare a Princess, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.74,0:07:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.06,0:07:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's chase him, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.02,0:08:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy, Opal! Come down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.22,0:08:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't escape me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.58,0:08:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,How clever! You fell\Ninto a man-made trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.62,0:08:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.26,0:08:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn fox! I'll catch\Nyou, sooner or later!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.18,0:08:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see which way to go...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.90,0:08:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This way... No, no!\NBetter this other way...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.58,0:08:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange, I smell humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.74,0:08:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet I don't see any
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.90,0:08:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's my nose\Nthat isn't working well today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.10,0:08:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I'm trapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.38,0:09:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But you haven't caught me yet\Nand I will sell my life dearly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.10,0:09:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A cannon! All right.\NAll right, then I surrender. Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.82,0:09:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Thank goodness, I caught that fox!\N- Well done, Plastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, look what a beautiful cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.74,0:09:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn it the other way!\NIt's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.18,0:09:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, son! You caught it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.30,0:09:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Plastic, you are becoming more capable\Nthan I had hoped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.26,0:09:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, dad!\NDon't I look like a King?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.62,0:09:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you really look like a King!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I can't wait\Nto see you sitting on the throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.74,0:09:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If my plans come true,\Nmy son,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.94,0:09:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,you will be the one, one day,\Nto sit on the throne of Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.74,0:09:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, dad!\NI want to become King!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.06,0:09:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,First we must get rid\Nof my nephew Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.50,0:09:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,...so that you can become King.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.54,0:09:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't feel like waiting!\NI want to be King!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.22,0:09:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop throwing tantrums!\NYou'll have to wait instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.70,0:09:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, why don't you act\Nlike a King and kill that beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.82,0:10:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, dad! Who do I have to kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.74,0:10:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of question is that!\NYou have to kill that fox, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.82,0:10:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor thing!\NI'm sorry to have to kill it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.54,0:10:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you thought, son, that if you are\Ncapable of killing this fox,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.06,0:10:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,you might also be able\Nto kill Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.38,0:10:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, kill it with the bow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.62,0:10:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.74,0:10:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.06,0:10:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you, dad, who told me\Nto kill it with the bow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.98,0:10:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- And this is the bow!\N- Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.06,0:10:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The bow is only used\Nto shoot the arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.66,0:10:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you are here, Grand\NDuke! I was looking for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.14,0:10:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron Nylon, what do you\Nhave so important to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I entered Sapphire's room\Nwhile he wasn't there...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.86,0:10:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I found a box. This one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.90,0:10:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- It looks like a girl's jewelry box!\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.02,0:10:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It could contain the\Nproof that Sapphire is a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.86,0:10:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had the proof, I could have\NSapphire sentenced to death...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.22,0:10:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,...since he pretended to be\Nmale to ascend the throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.14,0:11:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, the only claimant\Nwould be your son Plastic,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.26,0:11:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,who could soon have\Na crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.54,0:11:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open it!\NLet's see what's inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.90,0:11:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, how ugly it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.46,0:11:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,"Dear Mr. Petty Thief,\Ndid you like this joke of mine?"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.74,0:11:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!\NThe Prince made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.18,0:11:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you laughing at?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.34,0:11:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you interested in having proof that the\NPrince is, in reality, a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.46,0:11:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I'd be interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.62,0:11:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, if you set me free,\NI will provide you with this proof,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.26,0:11:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,because I know many things\Nthat you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.54,0:11:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I must look for Sapphire!\NI must warn him immediately...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.54,0:11:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...of the grave danger\Nthat he is in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.70,0:11:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.18,0:12:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, little bunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.06,0:12:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,By any chance have you seen around here\Na girl... I mean, a boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.22,0:12:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying he fell into a trap\Nand fell asleep in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.78,0:12:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are\Na smart little bunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.02,0:12:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! It's me: Tink!\NWake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.18,0:12:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tink!\N- Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.86,0:12:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,At the camp, Zul\Ntold Duralumin...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.98,0:12:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,...that he will give him\Nproof that you are a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.18,0:12:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would he do\Nsomething like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.86,0:12:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on to this! You\Ncan climb back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.58,0:12:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.50,0:12:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Zul?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.82,0:12:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in the camp\Nand we have to go...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.70,0:12:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn! I don't remember anymore\Nwhich direction I came from!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.34,0:12:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,At such an important moment\Nyou go and forget the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.14,0:12:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you scold me, then\NI'll remind you that a girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.06,0:12:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...shouldn't go hunting!\N- Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.22,0:12:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a child\Nand you don't know anything about these things!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.70,0:12:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop calling me "child"!\NAnd then please remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.38,0:13:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...that you too are still\Na child!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.06,0:13:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, it's not good to go hunting\Nand kill poor animals!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.02,0:13:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right! Let's go\Nin search of the camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.26,0:13:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll come back for you! Now I must\Nrun and I can't take you with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.18,0:13:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What trouble if Sapphire's\Nsecret is discovered...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.90,0:13:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I must get quickly\Nto the camp! Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.30,0:13:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mole! Mole!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.34,0:13:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello! How are you, friend?\NWill you do me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.22,0:13:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So, dad, can I kill\Nthis fox now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.30,0:13:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Be good and wait!\NYou will kill it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.10,0:13:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't feel like waiting! First\Nyou tell me I can kill it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.26,0:13:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,...and then you don't let me do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.54,0:13:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Be good, son! As soon as we have\Nproof that Sapphire is a girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.18,0:14:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I will allow you to kill\Nthis fox! Alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.86,0:14:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.46,0:14:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! You promised to tell us\Neverything once you were free.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.82,0:14:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know that men\Nwere so impetuous!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.74,0:14:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, that means I'll take\Nthe rest of the meal...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.26,0:14:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I'll go eat it in the woods.\N- But first give us proof!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.42,0:14:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot speak without having\Ncompleted a ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.46,0:14:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A ceremony?\NAnd what is it about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.70,0:14:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the ceremony\Nin which I solemnly swear.\N•
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.50,0:14:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,..that everything I will tell you\Nis true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.46,0:14:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me sulfur and oak leaves\Nand make a pile of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.70,0:14:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you need all these things?\N- What do you care?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.18,0:14:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring all these things right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.62,0:14:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, dad, can I kill her afterwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.06,0:14:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.50,0:14:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Baron Nylon,\Nplease, light a nice fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.46,0:14:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- You want a fire?!\N- I need a fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.74,0:15:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,for the ceremony! I must\Noffer a prayer to my ancestors!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.82,0:15:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I tricked you, Grand Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.10,0:15:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The fox has run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.02,0:15:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Chase it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.02,0:15:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean you found the fox?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.58,0:15:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I must run to warn Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.66,0:15:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.74,0:16:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.02,0:16:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.34,0:16:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,A mole told me\Nthat the fox...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.38,0:16:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,.got caught in a trap,\Nnear the swamp!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.10,0:16:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.06,0:16:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This time\NI won't let you escape, Zul!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.30,0:16:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Prince, let me go!\NMy little ones are waiting for me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.94,0:16:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,...and if I die,\Nwho will look after them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.58,0:16:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe you anymore! This time you won't\Nfool me with your whining!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.62,0:16:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die! If I die,\Nmy little ones will die too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.62,0:16:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They were just born\Nand they've already lost their mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.62,0:16:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, my dear little ones!\NI will never see you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.42,0:16:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you are about to lose\Nyour father too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.54,0:16:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it true, Zul?\NDo you really have cubs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.26,0:16:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, it's true!\NAnd they are cute, just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.30,0:16:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Zul, leave Tink alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.54,0:16:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now listen to me:\Nif you don't want me to bite your friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.86,0:16:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,free me from this trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, free me, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.74,0:17:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking this child with me\Nas a hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.02,0:17:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try to follow me or your\Nfriend will meet a bad end!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.02,0:17:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.42,0:17:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.22,0:17:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Zul!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.02,0:18:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You are surrounded!\NSurrender, Zul! You can't escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.74,0:18:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want, you can even kill\Nme, but this child will die with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.26,0:18:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And what do we care?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.42,0:18:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you understood perfectly\Nwell! We couldn't care less...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.86,0:18:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,..whether you kill that child!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.06,0:18:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This confirms to me that you\Nhumans are much more evil than us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.66,0:18:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't bring myself to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.70,0:18:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You can just go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.90,0:18:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Zul, be careful! And above all\Ndon't trust a guy like Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.66,0:18:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,With this collar,\Nyou won't be able to run far!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.02,0:18:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not stupid.\NI only run away when I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.62,0:18:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the voice of a bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.22,0:19:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, my little fox cubs!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.02,0:19:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That bear is attacking the fox cubs!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.02,0:19:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, everyone give chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.22,0:19:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, Zul, run away!\NThe bear will kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.02,0:19:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Your violence\Ndoesn't scare me at all, bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.26,0:20:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Zul didn't tell a lie\Nby saying he had three cubs!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.78,0:20:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Zul, now I will avenge you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.26,0:20:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know that Sapphire too\Nwas on Zul's trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.26,0:20:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant bear, I challenge you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.86,0:20:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Zul, stay and guard\Nthe fox cubs!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.58,0:20:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Friend mole, Sapphire is in\Ntrouble! We must help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.90,0:21:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Zul! I will use it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.22,0:21:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You came to help me too,\Nmole! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.82,0:21:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Sapphire! Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.46,0:21:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done! Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.66,0:21:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you eternal gratitude,\NPrince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.10,0:21:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It was magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.06,0:21:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Everything alright, Sapphire?\N- Yes, everything's fine, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.46,0:21:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about that big beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.42,0:21:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'll go check!\N- You are always an angel of goodness
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.06,0:21:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't get hurt too badly, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.42,0:21:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You fought very well,\NPrince, but I remind you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.94,0:21:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...that that fox belongs\Nto my son Plastic,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.06,0:22:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,because he is the one who caught it!\NGive it back to us immediately, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.74,0:22:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare that schemer...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.66,0:22:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't give Zul to anyone,\Nleast of all to you, Grand Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.86,0:22:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He must decide for himself,\Nto return with us of his own free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.90,0:22:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he prefers\Nreturning to captivity,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.70,0:22:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,rather than seeing them\Nkill all those little foxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.10,0:22:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Zul, watch out!\NIt's a trap! Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.02,0:22:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I know for sure that Prince\NSapphire, in reality, is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.14,0:22:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,In reality,\Nhe is definitely a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.38,0:22:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- You stupid idiot! Don't tell lies!\N- Look who's talking, you big liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.50,0:22:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This time I have betrayed\Nyou! Have no mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.38,0:22:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill all these beasts!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.50,0:22:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.34,0:22:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.90,0:23:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, let's escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.82,0:23:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Wait for me!\N- Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.46,0:23:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, bear!\NYou were very kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.90,0:23:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How cute\Nthis little fox is!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.58,0:23:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.66,0:23:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be better if we don't meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.94,0:23:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree. It is better that\Nhumans and foxes live apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.14,0:23:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, nature wants it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.26,0:23:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You helped me\Nand I helped you,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.58,0:23:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but now we must part.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.34,0:23:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.14,0:23:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Goodbye, friends!\N- Take care, animal friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.22,0:23:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.58,0:23:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, I heard that you\Ncaptured the golden fox.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.94,0:23:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I had almost managed to catch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.22,0:23:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How skilled you are\Nto have caught that fox!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.02,0:23:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean you didn't catch it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.06,0:23:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I catch it, I will give it to you as a gift!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.06,0:23:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How kind you are!
